  "_note": "Minimum Support Price (न्यूनतम समर्थन मूल्य) per crop, ₹/quintal — the same unit Agmarknet reports modal_price in, so the two compare directly with no conversion. Updated TWICE A YEAR (Kharif ~June, Rabi ~October) by CACP/Cabinet; this file is the single source of truth and is read live by mtime, so a correction needs no deploy. TWO SAFETY RULES ARE ENFORCED IN CODE, not by discipline: (1) a crop renders ONLY when verified:true — an unconfirmed number stays invisible instead of misleading a farmer into selling below MSP; (2) a season stops rendering after its valid_until date, so a stale MSP can never quietly outlive its marketing season. Matching is EXACT on the aliases list (normalised lowercase), never keyword-fuzzy: a keyword match would put wheat's MSP on 'Wheat Atta' and mustard's on 'Mustard Oil'. Basmati paddy is deliberately absent — it is not procured at MSP. Sugarcane is absent too: it has an FRP, not an MSP, and mislabelling the two is exactly the kind of error this file exists to avoid.",
